# Bindings.xml is deliberately NOT listed here. The client loads it
# automatically from the addon root, matching it by name - which is why it
# must be called exactly that. Listing it sends it through the general UI XML
# loader as well, and that loader has no <Binding> element in its schema, so
# every attribute logs a warning ("Unrecognized XML: Binding", "Unrecognized
# XML attribute: name/header") while the real, automatic load still supplies
# the keybinding.
